{
  "id": "ad6Ql8UdT0yq96Cv",
  "name": "Assert Outcome (sub-workflow)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assert Outcome (sub-workflow)\nThe fix for *'every node was green and zero rows landed'*: an execution is only a success if the **work** happened.\n\nCall it from any workflow right after the write step with **Execute Workflow**:\n\n- `label`: \"rows appended to Leads sheet\"\n- `actual`: `{{ $items().length }}` or a count from the API response\n- `min`: 1 (default) · `max`: optional ceiling (catches runaway loops too)\n- `context`: `{{ $workflow.name }} #{{ $execution.id }}`\n\nIf the number is outside bounds it throws **Stop and Error**, which fails the caller's execution and fires your Error Workflow. Inside bounds it returns a receipt item you can log.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f9d59798-4b7f-4e11-be0e-d28ac593eaef",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "workflowInputs",
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "label",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "actual",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "name": "min",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "name": "max",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "name": "context",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "43d7fdb0-058f-47f0-ad83-48d47b8c76b0",
      "name": "When called by another workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Compare what actually happened with what the caller expected, and produce a receipt.\nconst items = $input.all();\nreturn items.map(({ json }) => {\n  const actual = Number(json.actual);\n  const min = json.min === undefined || json.min === null || json.min === '' ? 1 : Number(json.min);\n  const max = json.max === undefined || json.max === null || json.max === '' ? null : Number(json.max);\n  const ok = Number.isFinite(actual) && actual >= min && (max === null || actual <= max);\n  return { json: {\n    label: json.label || 'unlabelled check',\n    context: json.context || '',\n    actual, min, max, ok,\n    checkedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n    checkedBy: $workflow.name,\n    reason: ok ? 'within bounds' : (!Number.isFinite(actual) ? 'actual is not a number' : (actual < min ? `below minimum ${min}` : `above maximum ${max}`)),\n  }};\n});"
      },
      "id": "2d2ecd69-49ea-4fb3-82bb-a618845ec8b0",
      "name": "Evaluate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        60,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
